Report tracked Vulkan allocation capacities and release transfer staging alone.
Co-created with GPT (OpenAI), 2026-11-11. See NOTICE for project terms.

Keep logical pool/persistent totals stable; report actual vkAllocateMemory sizes
separately, including upload/read staging and the inline argument ring. Neither
ledger measures process RSS or driver-private allocations. An explicit transfer
trim waits on the queue mutex and preserves image buffers, idle pool and ring.
Pixel kernels, defaults and automatic eviction behavior are unchanged.

